{
  "abstract": "A continuous weakly mixing self-map of a nonempty compact Hausdorff space has a transitive actual heterogeneous product with any continuous pointwise forward-minimal self-map of a nonempty compact space. Surjectivity, arbitrarily late thick hitting blocks, syndetic hitting gaps and their intersection are proved.",
